  "classification": "test synchronization race; production scheduler behavior unchanged",
  "causalExplanation": "The replay pump admits B and C without awaiting either custom callback; RefreshLaneOnceAsync runs each callback with Task.Run. The old test waited only for C callback entry, which does not establish that the already-admitted B callback executed. A single worker can execute C and the C-signal test continuation before B. Therefore readsB=1 is an invalid ordering assumption, not a missing replay admission.",
